{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SealChain is a roguelike game where items can link together to form chain reactions. Items can also be arranged into specific formations to create seals, granting special effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is falling apart. Chaotic evil shrouds the land like a dense purple fog. In this catastrophe, countless innocent beings have turned into cursed monsters. There is no savior here. Ancient sorcery is reviving, empowering the &quot;Mediums&quot;. With the power of seals, cleanse the end-time evils.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652600/extras/9357beb6425a81c8c64286046aeca66a.avif?t=1755596788\" data-has-big width=800 height=422 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Items can link together to form chain reactions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Items can be arranged into specific formations to create seals, granting special effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Event system that provides various items through randomly triggered events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A wide variety of items, classes, monsters, and events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Different rewards from various NPCs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Items can be stacked infinitely</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Unlimited combat power for exponential excitement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Endless mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Easy-to-create MODs, allowing you to create items, monsters, characters, and events without programming knowledge</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >When the items are linked together, they will form a seal.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autop